    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0766",
      "reading_order": 897,
      "section": "8.1  General Instructions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 604.3665,
        "r": 227.0625,
        "b": 587.4375
      },
      "content": "8.1  General Instructions",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0767",
      "reading_order": 898,
      "section": "8.1  General Instructions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 573.75375,
        "r": 470.0625,
        "b": 560.99625
      },
      "content": "To ship the monitor for any reason, follow the instructions in this section."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0768",
      "reading_order": 899,
      "section": "8.1  General Instructions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 546.75375,
        "r": 539.0628000000002,
        "b": 493.49625
      },
      "content": "Pack the monitor carefully. Failure to follow the instructions in this section may result in loss or damage not covered by the Nellcor warranty. If the original shipping carton is not available, use another suitable carton; North American customers may call Nellcor Technical Services to obtain a shipping carton."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0769",
      "reading_order": 900,
      "section": "8.1  General Instructions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 492.75375,
        "r": 539.0625499999998,
        "b": 439.49625
      },
      "content": "Prior  to  shipping  the  monitor,  contact  your  supplier  or  the  local  Nellcor  office (Technical  Services  Department)  for  a  returned  goods  authorization  (RGA) number. Mark  the  shipping  carton  and  any  shipping  documents  with  the  returned  goods authorization number."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0770",
      "reading_order": 901,
      "section": "8.1  General Instructions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 425.25375,
        "r": 537.6967499999998,
        "b": 371.99625
      },
      "content": "Pack to shipping the monitor, contact your supplier or local Nellcor office (Technical Services  Department)  for  a  returned  goods  authorization  number.  Mark  the  shipping carton  and  any  shipping  documents  with  the  returned  goods  authorization  (RGA) number. Return the N5500 by any method that provides proof of delivery."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0771",
      "reading_order": 902,
      "section": "8.2  Returning the N5500",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 361.3665,
        "r": 229.3125,
        "b": 344.4375
      },
      "content": "8.2  Returning the N5500",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0772",
      "reading_order": 903,
      "section": "8.2  Returning the N5500",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 330.75375,
        "r": 539.0636000000005,
        "b": 250.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "Contact Nellcor Technical Services Department or your local Nellcor representative for shipping  instructions,  including  a  Returned  Goods  Authorization  (RGA)  number. Unless  otherwise  instructed  by  Nellcor  Technical  Services  Department,  it  is  not necessary to return the  sensor  or  other  accessory  items  with  the  monitor.  Pack  the N5500  in  its original   shipping  carton.  If  the  original  carton  is  not  available,  use  a suitable carton with appropriate packing material  to protect it during shipping."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0773",
      "reading_order": 904,
      "section": "8.3  Repacking In Original Carton",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 239.86649999999997,
        "r": 285.5625,
        "b": 222.9375
      },
      "content": "8.3  Repacking In Original Carton",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0774",
      "reading_order": 905,
      "section": "8.3  Repacking In Original Carton",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.5,
        "t": 209.25374999999997,
        "r": 530.8125,
        "b": 196.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "If available, use the original carton and packing materials. Pack the monitor as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0775",
      "reading_order": 906,
      "section": "8.3  Repacking In Original Carton",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.5,
        "t": 182.25374999999997,
        "r": 487.3125,
        "b": 169.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "Place the monitor and, if necessary, accessory items in original packaging."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0776",
      "reading_order": 907,
      "section": "8.3  Repacking In Original Carton",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.5,
        "t": 155.25374999999997,
        "r": 429.5625,
        "b": 142.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "Place in shipping carton and seal carton with packaging tape."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0777",
      "reading_order": 908,
      "section": "8.3  Repacking In Original Carton",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.5,
        "t": 128.25374999999997,
        "r": 524.0625,
        "b": 115.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "Label carton with shipping address, return address and RGA number, if applicable."
    }
  ],
